      "long_description": {
        "text": "He ain't the brightest but he sure is the toughest. Sarge adds insults to injuries but don\u2019t let him get to ya\u2019. Not just a state-sponsored, brain-washed killing machine, he can set up spawn points too!",
        "data": {
          "ru": {
            "original": "He ain't the brightest but he sure is the toughest. Sarge adds insults to injuries but don\u2019t let him get to ya\u2019. Not just a state-sponsored, brain-washed killing machine, he can set up spawn points too!",
            "translation": "\u041f\u0443\u0441\u0442\u044c \u043e\u043d \u043d\u0435 \u0441\u0430\u043c\u044b\u0439 \u0443\u043c\u043d\u044b\u0439, \u0437\u0430\u0442\u043e \u0443\u0436 \u0442\u043e\u0447\u043d\u043e \u0441\u0430\u043c\u044b\u0439 \u043a\u0440\u0443\u0442\u043e\u0439. Sarge \u0437\u043d\u0430\u0435\u0442 \u0442\u043e\u043b\u043a \u0432 \u0443\u0432\u0435\u0447\u044c\u044f\u0445, \u043f\u043e\u044d\u0442\u043e\u043c\u0443 \u043d\u0435 \u0441\u0442\u043e\u0438\u0442 \u043f\u043e\u043f\u0430\u0434\u0430\u0442\u044c\u0441\u044f \u0443 \u043d\u0435\u0433\u043e \u043d\u0430 \u043f\u0443\u0442\u0438. \u041a\u0441\u0442\u0430\u0442\u0438, \u044d\u0442\u043e \u043d\u0435 \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0441\u0442\u043e \u0441\u043f\u043e\u043d\u0441\u0438\u0440\u0443\u0435\u043c\u0430\u044f \u0433\u043e\u0441\u0443\u0434\u0430\u0440\u0441\u0442\u0432\u043e\u043c \u043c\u0430\u0448\u0438\u043d\u0430 \u0434\u043b\u044f \u0443\u0431\u0438\u0439\u0441\u0442\u0432, \u043a\u043e\u0442\u043e\u0440\u043e\u0439 \u043f\u0440\u043e\u043c\u044b\u043b\u0438 \u043c\u043e\u0437\u0433\u0438, \u0432\u0435\u0434\u044c \u043e\u043d \u0443\u043c\u0435\u0435\u0442 \u0442\u0430\u043a\u0436\u0435 \u0441\u043e\u0437\u0434\u0430\u0432\u0430\u0442\u044c \u0442\u043e\u0447\u043a\u0438 \u0432\u043e\u0437\u0440\u043e\u0436\u0434\u0435\u043d\u0438\u044f."
          },
          "es": {
            "original": "He ain't the brightest but he sure is the toughest. Sarge adds insults to injuries but don\u2019t let him get to ya\u2019. Not just a state-sponsored, brain-washed killing machine, he can set up spawn points too!",
            "translation": "Stone siempre est\u00e1 dispuesto a colocarse al frente de las l\u00edneas enemigas y arriesgar su vida por la patria y por su equipo. Su arsenal de explosivos no deja nada librado al azar: lanzacohetes, granadas y C4. \u00a1Si explota, \u00e9l lo tiene!"
          },
          "de": {
            "original": "He ain't the brightest but he sure is the toughest. Sarge adds insults to injuries but don\u2019t let him get to ya\u2019. Not just a state-sponsored, brain-washed killing machine, he can set up spawn points too!",
            "translation": "Er ist nicht der Hellste, daf\u00fcr aber definitiv der H\u00e4rteste. Sarge kann einen ordentlich fertigmachen, wenn man es zul\u00e4sst. Aber er ist nicht blo\u00df eine staatlich gef\u00f6rderte und kontrollierte T\u00f6tungsmaschine, er kann auch Respawnfelder platzieren!"
          },
          "pt": {
            "original": "He ain't the brightest but he sure is the toughest. Sarge adds insults to injuries but don\u2019t let him get to ya\u2019. Not just a state-sponsored, brain-washed killing machine, he can set up spawn points too!",
            "translation": "Ele pode n\u00e3o ser o mais astuto, mas \u00e9, sem d\u00favida, o mais dur\u00e3o. Sarge joga sal na ferida, ent\u00e3o n\u00e3o deixe ele chegar perto. Al\u00e9m de ser uma m\u00e1quina mort\u00edfera sem igual, ele sabe montar pontos de ressurgimento tamb\u00e9m!"
          },
          "fr": {
            "original": "He ain't the brightest but he sure is the toughest. Sarge adds insults to injuries but don\u2019t let him get to ya\u2019. Not just a state-sponsored, brain-washed killing machine, he can set up spawn points too!",
            "translation": "Ce n'est pas une lumi\u00e8re, mais c'est l'un des plus costauds. Sarge est une vraie terreur, mais ne vous laissez pas faire. Cette machine \u00e0 tuer au service du gouvernement peut aussi placer des points d'apparition\u00a0!"
          }
        }
      },
