        "description": {
          "text": "Sarge regenerates health when low on hit points. Get back up and fight soldier!",
          "data": {
            "ru": {
              "original": "Sarge regenerates health when low on hit points. Get back up and fight soldier!",
              "translation": "\u0421\u0435\u0440\u0436\u0430\u043d\u0442 \u0431\u044b\u0441\u0442\u0440\u043e \u0437\u0430\u043b\u0435\u0447\u0438\u0432\u0430\u0435\u0442 \u0440\u0430\u043d\u044b, \u043a\u043e\u0433\u0434\u0430 \u0443 \u043d\u0435\u0433\u043e \u043e\u0441\u0442\u0430\u0435\u0442\u0441\u044f \u043c\u0430\u043b\u043e \u0437\u0434\u043e\u0440\u043e\u0432\u044c\u044f. \u0412\u0441\u0442\u0430\u0432\u0430\u0439 \u0438 \u0432\u043e\u0437\u0432\u0440\u0430\u0449\u0430\u0439\u0441\u044f \u0432 \u0431\u043e\u0439, \u0441\u043e\u043b\u0434\u0430\u0442!"
            },
            "es": {
              "original": "Sarge regenerates health when low on hit points. Get back up and fight soldier!",
              "translation": "Regenera su nivel de salud cuando est\u00e1 bajo."
            },
            "de": {
              "original": "Sarge regenerates health when low on hit points. Get back up and fight soldier!",
              "translation": "Sarges Gesundheit wird wiederhergestellt, wenn sie zu stark absinkt. Aufstehen und weiterk\u00e4mpfen, Soldat!"
            },
            "pt": {
              "original": "Sarge regenerates health when low on hit points. Get back up and fight soldier!",
              "translation": "Sarge ativa sua fun\u00e7\u00e3o de regenera\u00e7\u00e3o quando seus pontos de vida est\u00e3o baixos. Levante-se e lute, soldado!"
            },
            "fr": {
              "original": "Sarge regenerates health when low on hit points. Get back up and fight soldier!",
              "translation": "La sant\u00e9 de Sarge se r\u00e9g\u00e9n\u00e8re lorsque son nombre de points de vie est bas. On se rel\u00e8ve et on repart au combat, soldat\u00a0!"
            }
          }
        }
